2026-03-10 12:13:18,632 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 131, "content": "You are a product manager for automation architecture planning. Produce implementation-oriented planning output, not workflow JSON.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 3457, "content": "Create a planning-level architecture for a future engineer implementation.\nRules:\n- Do not generate workflow JSON.\n- Do not set node parameters or credential values.\n- Keep the plan one level above implementation details.\n- Stages must be concrete and implementation-ready.\n- Record assumptions and missing information instead of guessing.\n- Treat nodes with usage_mode=tool_only as AI-tool sub-nodes; do not use them as standard action steps.\n- You may reference only these node types as required nodes: @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow, n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap, n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImapTool, n8n-nodes-base.emailSend, n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool, n8n-nodes-base.mailjet, n8n-nodes-base.mailjetTool, n8n-nodes-base.code, n8n-nodes-base.executionData, n8n-nodes-base.mediumTool.\n\nSelected use case:\n- id: uc_1\n- title: Bulk Email Triage with Urgency-Based Routing\n- business_problem: Lack of systematic urgency classification leads to missed deadlines or delayed responses on critical emails.\n- desired_outcome: Automatically classify incoming emails into urgency tiers (e.g., 'High', 'Medium', 'Low') and route them accordingly, with a digest summarizing the top 10 urgent emails received since the last digest.\n- expected_value: Improve operational efficiency by 60% through automated prioritization, reducing stress on manual triage and ensuring no urgent email is overlooked.\n\nRetrieved node evidence:\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow | display=Call n8n Workflow Tool | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap | display=Email Trigger (IMAP) | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImapTool | display=Email Trigger (IMAP) Tool | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | display=Send Email | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=action_only | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=True\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | display=Send Email Tool | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.mailjet | display=Mailjet | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=both | usable_as_tool=True | has_main_input=True\n- n8n-nodes-base.mailjetTool | display=Mailjet Tool | evidence_confidence=0.66 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.66 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | display=Code | evidence_confidence=0.63 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.63 | usage_mode=action_only | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=True\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | display=Execution Data | evidence_confidence=0.62 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.62 | usage_mode=action_only | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=True\n- n8n-nodes-base.mediumTool | display=Medium Tool | evidence_confidence=0.61 | rerank_confidence=n/a | blended_confidence=0.61 | usage_mode=unknown | usable_as_tool=False | has_main_input=unknown\n\nReturn structured output only.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "0e95a0b196", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.structured", "total_