query_text:
  Use case title: Periodic Email Digest with Urgency Summary
  Business problem: Receiving a high volume of emails makes it difficult to stay updated without spending hours daily, and there’s no consolidated view of processed emails.
  Desired outcome: An automated digest email sent every 10 received emails (or at a custom interval), summarizing the batch with counts by urgency category and key details (sender, subject, timestamp).
  Expected business value: Reduces inbox clutter, provides actionable insights into email trends, and allows for batch processing of non-urgent emails.
  Goal: retrieve n8n API/docs evidence for required workflow nodes.
