 rather than individual emails.\", \"expected_value\": \"Operational efficiency gains, better oversight of email workflows.\", \"feasibility\": \"High\", \"value_score\": 5.0, \"clarity_score\": 4.0, \"actionability_score\": 4.0}], \"notes\": [\"All candidates are actionable and address core pain points without requiring technical design. Feasibility is high for summarization/digest due to mature AI/email integration solutions, while urgency classification may require tuning (e.g., rule-based or ML models).\", \"No dependencies on specific tools (e.g., n8n) were assumed; candidates are vendor-agnostic.\"]}", "event": "llm_output", "latency_ms": 8349.608, "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "36fa0c0faf", "stage": "multi_agent.commercial.structured", "temperature": 0.1, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T12:02:38.195702+00:00"}
