query_text:
  Use case title: Periodic Email Digest with Summary Report
  Business problem: Receive consolidated reports of processed emails (e.g., every 10 emails) to review trends and key actions.
  Desired outcome: Bulk processing visibility; ability to act on batches rather than individual emails.
  Expected business value: Operational efficiency gains, better oversight of email workflows.
  Goal: retrieve n8n API/docs evidence for required workflow nodes.
