query_text:
  Use case title: Periodic Email Digest with Urgency Highlighting
  Business problem: Avoid email overload by consolidating incoming emails into digestible reports sent at configurable intervals (e.g., every 10 emails).
  Desired outcome: Receive a single email per batch containing summaries, urgency indicators, and key details of the last N emails.
  Expected business value: Reduced inbox clutter; faster action on urgent items; ability to review batches without constant monitoring.
  Goal: retrieve n8n API/docs evidence for required workflow nodes.
