2026-03-10 20:53:43,637 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 152, "content": "You are a commercial discovery specialist for automation opportunities. Extract business use-case candidates only. Do not design technical architecture.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 823, "content": "Return structured output with:\n- business_context_summary: short structured business context\n- candidates: normalized automation use-case candidates\n- notes: optional diagnostics\n\nRules:\n- Focus on business value first.\n- Do not mention n8n nodes, credentials, implementation parameters, or workflow JSON.\n- Keep candidates specific and actionable.\n- Provide scores in [0..5]: value_score, clarity_score, actionability_score.\n- feasibility should be textual (high/medium/low + short reason).\n- If nothing actionable exists, return an empty candidates list.\n\nBusiness input:\ntengo un problema con mi negocio y es que recibo demasiados correos al dia, entonces megustaria resumirlos con ia, clasificarlos por urgenmcia y recibir un correo cada 10 recibidos que haga esto, y me mande un correo con el informe de los 10 correos", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.commercial.structured", "total_chars": 975, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:53:43.637171+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:53:51,748 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 2784, "content_preview": "{\"business_context_summary\": {\"process_scope\": \"Email management\", \"pain_points\": [\"High email volume overwhelming daily operations\", \"Lack of prioritization for urgent emails\", \"Need for periodic summaries to improve efficiency\"], \"desired_outcomes\": [\"Automated email summarization with AI\", \"Classification by urgency level\", \"Periodic (e.g., every 10 emails) digest emails with summary and details\"], \"constraints\": [\"Must integrate with existing email system (e.g., Gmail, Outlook)\", \"Should preserve original email content for reference\", \"User should control frequency of digests\"]}, \"candidates\": [{\"title\": \"AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\", \"business_problem\": \"Reduce cognitive load from high email volume by automatically summarizing and classifying emails based on urgency.\", \"desired_outcome\": \"Enable users to quickly scan prioritized summaries instead of processing individual emails, improving productivity.\", \"expected_value\": \"Save 2-4 hours per day for knowledge workers; reduce stress from information overload.\", \"feasibility\": \"High\", \"value_score\": 5.0, \"clarity_score\": 5.0, \"actionability_score\": 4.0}, {\"title\": \"Periodic Email Digest with Urgency-Based Grouping\", \"business_problem\": \"Avoid manual review of every email by receiving consolidated digests that group emails by urgency level.\", \"desired_outcome\": \"Replace reactive email processing with proactive, structured digest reviews, improving focus and response time for high-priority items.\", \"expected_value\": \"Reduce inbox management time by 30-50%; improve prioritization accuracy.\", \"feasibility\": \"High\", \"value_score\": 4.0, \"clarity_score\": 5.0, \"actionability_score\": 4.0}, {\"title\": \"Customizable Digest Frequency Control\", \"business_problem\": \"Allow users to define the trigger for digest generation (e.g., every N emails or at specific intervals) without manual intervention.\", \"desired_outcome\": \"Increase flexibility in email processing workflows, adapting to varying workload demands.\", \"expected_value\": \"Improve user satisfaction with adaptable automation; reduce setup overhead.\", \"feasibility\": \"Medium\", \"value_score\": 3.0, \"clarity_score\": 4.0, \"actionability_score\": 3.0}], \"notes\": [\"The core value lies in combining summarization and urgency classification to transform reactive email handling into a proactive, structured process. The digest feature (every 10 emails) is a strong candidate as it directly addresses the user's stated need for periodic updates.\", \"Clarity is high because the problem statement is specific about desired outputs (summaries, urgency labels, digests). Actionability could be slightly lower if integration with existing email systems introduces complexity, but this is a business-level constraint to be addressed later.\"]}", "event": "llm_output", "latency_ms": 8109.698, "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.commercial.structured", "temperature": 0.1, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:53:51.748982+00:00"}
