2026-03-10 20:54:39,765 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 686, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 103, "content": "You are a Product Manager selecting nodes for one workflow stage. Select only from provided candidates.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 1908, "content": "Select the best node bundle for this stage.\nUse case: AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\nStage id: stage_1\nStage objective: Collect incoming emails from configured sources and prepare raw data for AI processing.\nExpected inputs: Raw email messages (subject, body, sender metadata, timestamp)\nExpected outputs: Structured email payloads with normalized fields (e.g., sender, content, timestamp), attachments extracted if applicable.\nRules:\n- Select only node types listed in candidates.\n- Prefer business-fit and stage objective alignment.\n- If evidence is insufficient, return empty selected_node_types and explain missing information.\nCandidates:\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.55 | rerank=0.24 | capability=Sends emails via SMTP. | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.55 | rerank=0.24 | capability=Sends emails (tool variant). | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials.; Usage mode unknown.\n- n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.77 | capability=Transforms data using Action Network API. | limitations=Requires Action Network API credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.77 | capability=Transforms data using Active Campaign API. | limitations=Requires Active Campaign API credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | fit_hint=0.57 | rerank=0.4 | capability=Executes custom code for transformations. | limitations=-\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow | fit_hint=0.55 | rerank=0.35 | capability=Uses another n8n workflow as a tool. | limitations=Usage mode unknown.\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | fit_hint=0.57 | rerank=0.4 | capability=Provides execution data (e.g., timestamps, IDs). | limitations=-\n- n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets | fit_hint=0.55 | rerank=0.35 | capability=Reads, updates, or writes data to Google Sheets. | limitations=Requires Google API and OAuth2 credentials.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 2011, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:54:39.765007+00:00"}
