ls via IMAP and retrieves raw email data. | limitations=Requires IMAP credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImapTool | fit_hint=0.62 | rerank=0.48 | capability=Triggers on incoming emails via IMAP and retrieves raw email data. | limitations=Requires IMAP credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.72 | capability=Sends emails (SMTP-based). | limitations=Action-only mode; requires SMTP credentials.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.72 | capability=Sends emails (SMTP-based). | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 2331, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:55:20.824994+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:55:24,232 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 1088, "content_preview": "{\"selected_node_types\":[\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor\",\"n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap\"],\"rationale\":\"For this stage, the primary objective is to collect incoming emails and prepare raw data for AI processing. The 'emailReadImap' node is the best fit for collecting raw email messages from configured IMAP sources, as it directly aligns with the expected inputs (raw email messages) and outputs (structured email payloads).\\n\\nThe 'informationExtractor' node is selected to transform the raw email data into a structured format suitable for AI processing. It can handle text extraction and normalization, which aligns with the stage's objective of preparing data for AI-powered summarization and urgency classification.\\n\\nOther candidates like 'awsTextract' or its tool variant are not ideal here because they focus on OCR and text extraction from documents, which is not a core requirement for this stage. The 'emailSend' nodes are also irrelevant as they are designed for sending emails, not collecting or processing them.\",\"pm_fit_score\":0.625,\"missing_information\":[]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:55:24.232917+00:00"}
