ions/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.emailimap/\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImapTool | fit_hint=0.58 | rerank=0.34 | capability=Triggers on incoming IMAP emails (tool variant). | limitations=Same as emailReadImap; usage_mode unclear.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.72 | capability=Sends formatted emails via SMTP. | limitations=Action-only node (no data collection). Requires SMTP credentials.; Documentation: https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.sendemail/\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.72 | capability=Sends formatted emails (tool variant). | limitations=Same as emailSend; usage_mode unclear.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 2441, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:56:03.848462+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:56:08,121 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 1200, "content_preview": "{\"selected_node_types\":[\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor\",\"n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap\"],\"rationale\":\"The stage objective is to collect incoming emails and prepare raw data for AI processing. The best fit candidates are:\\n\\n1. **n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap**: This node directly aligns with the expected input (raw email messages) and its capability of fetching raw email data (subject, body, sender metadata, timestamp). It is a core node for collecting emails from IMAP sources.\\n\\n2. **@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor**: This node fits the stage's objective of transforming raw data into structured information, which is essential for preparing email content (e.g., subject, body) and metadata for AI processing. It also supports urgency classification if configured properly.\\n\\nThe other candidates are less suitable:\\n- **awsTextract-related nodes**: These are specialized for OCR/text extraction from PDFs/images, not raw emails or text summarization.\\n- **emailSend-related nodes**: These are action-only nodes for sending emails, which do not align with the data collection and preparation objective of this stage.\",\"pm_fit_score\":0.92,\"missing_information\":[]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:56:08.121495+00:00"}
