2026-03-10 20:58:19,271 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 1010, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 103, "content": "You are a Product Manager selecting nodes for one workflow stage. Select only from provided candidates.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 2880, "content": "Select the best node bundle for this stage.\nUse case: AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\nStage id: stage_3\nStage objective: Enhance AI outputs with contextual data (e.g., sender reputation, historical patterns) to improve relevance.\nExpected inputs: Summarized emails with urgency labels from Stage 2\nExpected outputs: Enriched email summaries with additional metadata (e.g., sender trust score, related threads, suggested actions).\nRules:\n- Select only node types listed in candidates.\n- Prefer business-fit and stage objective alignment.\n- If evidence is insufficient, return empty selected_node_types and explain missing information.\nCandidates:\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.56 | rerank=0.27 | capability=Sends emails using SMTP credentials. | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials; Limited to email sending functionality\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.56 | rerank=0.27 | capability=Sends emails (tool variant). | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials; Usage mode unknown, potentially redundant with n8n-nodes-base.emailSend\n- n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork | fit_hint=0.61 | rerank=0.56 | capability=Transforms data using Action Network API. | limitations=Requires Action Network API credentials; Not directly related to email summarization or urgency classification\n- n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign | fit_hint=0.61 | rerank=0.56 | capability=Transforms data using Active Campaign API. | limitations=Requires Active Campaign API credentials; Not directly related to email summarization or urgency classification\n- n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform | fit_hint=0.56 | rerank=0.35 | capability=Applies AI transformations (e.g., NLP, summarization). | limitations=No explicit mention of contextual data integration; Usage mode is action-only, limiting flexibility\n- n8n-nodes-base.Brandfetch | fit_hint=0.56 | rerank=0.35 | capability=Fetches brand-related data (e.g., logos, colors). | limitations=Requires Brandfetch API credentials; Not directly related to email summarization or urgency classification\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | fit_hint=0.51 | rerank=0.15 | capability=Executes custom code transformations. | limitations=No built-in AI capabilities; Usage mode is action-only, limiting flexibility\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow | fit_hint=0.54 | rerank=0.3 | capability=Uses another n8n workflow as a tool (potential for modularity). | limitations=Usage mode unknown; No explicit AI or email-related capabilities\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | fit_hint=0.50 | rerank=0.15 | capability=Provides execution data (e.g., workflow runs, errors). | limitations=Not directly related to AI or email processing; Usage mode is action-only\n- n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets | fit_hint=0.54 | rerank=0.3 | capability=Reads/writes data to Google Sheets. | limitations=Requires Google API credentials; Not directly related to AI or email processing", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 2983, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:58:19.271368+00:00"}
