angchain.vectorStoreQdrant\",\"capability_summary\":\"Manages vector embeddings in Qdrant (e.g., stores or retrieves contextual data).\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires Qdrant API credentials.\"]}]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_candidate_summary", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:05.662208+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:59:07,687 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 930, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 103, "content": "You are a Product Manager selecting nodes for one workflow stage. Select only from provided candidates.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 2638, "content": "Select the best node bundle for this stage.\nUse case: AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\nStage id: stage_3\nStage objective: Enhance AI outputs with contextual data (e.g., sender reputation, historical patterns) to improve relevance.\nExpected inputs: Summarized emails with urgency labels from Stage 2\nExpected outputs: Enriched email summaries with additional metadata (e.g., sender trust score, related threads, suggested actions).\nRules:\n- Select only node types listed in candidates.\n- Prefer business-fit and stage objective alignment.\n- If evidence is insufficient, return empty selected_node_types and explain missing information.\nCandidates:\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.68 | capability=Transforms input data (e.g., extracts structured information from text). | limitations=No explicit credentials required, but likely depends on LangChain backend.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.69 | rerank=0.77 | capability=Sends emails via SMTP. | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials.; Action-only (cannot retrieve data).\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.69 | rerank=0.77 | capability=Sends emails (likely a variant of `emailSend`). | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials.; Usage mode unclear (possibly action-only).\n- n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork | fit_hint=0.71 | rerank=0.93 | capability=Transforms data and interacts with Action Network API (e.g., fetches or updates records). | limitations=Requires Action Network API credentials.; Can act as both action and trigger.\n- n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign | fit_hint=0.71 | rerank=0.93 | capability=Transforms data and interacts with ActiveCampaign API (e.g., manages contacts or campaigns). | limitations=Requires ActiveCampaign API credentials.; Can act as both action and trigger.\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | fit_hint=0.71 | rerank=0.94 | capability=Executes custom code (e.g., JavaScript) to transform or process data. | limitations=No explicit credentials required, but requires coding knowledge.\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | fit_hint=0.70 | rerank=0.94 | capability=Provides runtime execution data (e.g., workflow context). | limitations=Action-only (cannot retrieve external data).\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.ollama | fit_hint=0.69 | rerank=0.9 | capability=Transforms input using Ollama AI models (e.g., generates or processes text). | limitations=Requires Ollama API credentials.\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant | fit_hint=0.69 | rerank=0.9 | capability=Manages vector embeddings in Qdrant (e.g., stores or retrieves contextual data). | limitations=Requires Qdrant API credentials.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 2741, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:07.687356+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:59:14,445 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 1803, "content_preview": "{\"selected_node_types\":[\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant\",\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-base.code\"],\"rationale\":\"The selected nodes align with the stage objective of enriching AI outputs with contextual data:\\n\\n1. **@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant**:\\n   - Capability: Manages vector embeddings in Qdrant, enabling retrieval of contextual data (e.g., sender reputation, historical patterns).\\n   - Fit: High rerank score (0.9) indicates strong alignment with the use case.\\n   - Limitations: Requires Qdrant API credentials, but this is acceptable for a production-ready workflow if configured.\\n\\n2. **@n8n/n8n-nodes-base.code**:\\n   - Capability: Executes custom code to transform or process data (e.g., combining extracted metadata with the summarized email).\\n   - Fit: High rerank score (0.94) and flexibility for business-specific logic (e.g., calculating trust scores, suggesting actions).\\n   - Limitations: Requires coding knowledge, but this is manageable for a product manager overseeing development.\\n\\n### Why not other candidates?:\\n- **Information Extractor**: While it can extract structured data, its fit_hint (0.67) and rerank (0.68) are lower than the selected nodes, and it lacks explicit support for contextual enrichment like sender reputation.\\n- **Email Send/Action Network/ActiveCampaign**: These are action-oriented or require external API credentials that don't directly address the stage's objective of enriching data.\\n- **Execution Data/Ollama**: ExecutionData is action-only, and Ollama focuses on AI generation rather than contextual enrichment.\\n\\n### Missing Information?:\\nNo critical evidence is missing. The selected nodes cover both retrieval (vectorStoreQdrant) and transformation (code) needs for the stage.\",\"pm_fit_score\":0.92,\"missing_information\":[]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:14.445461+00:00"}
