2026-03-10 20:59:42,459 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 851, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 90, "content": "You are a Product Manager assistant. Summarize node candidates based strictly on evidence.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 2416, "content": "Summarize each node candidate for this stage with concise capability summary and limitations.\nUse case: AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\nStage: stage_4 - Route processed emails to users via their preferred channels (e.g., inbox, dashboard, or notification system).\nCandidates:\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow | capability=Description: Uses another n8n workflow as a tool. | limitations=Required Credentials: [] | usage_mode=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | capability=Display Name: Send Email | limitations=Required Credentials: [\"smtp\"]; Documentation URLs: [\"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.sendemail/\", \"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/sendemail/\"] | usage_mode=action_only\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | capability=Display Name: Send Email Tool | limitations=Required Credentials: [\"smtp\"]; Documentation URLs: [\"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.sendemail/\", \"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/sendemail/\"] | usage_mode=unknown\n- n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork | capability=Group: [\"transform\"] | limitations=Required Credentials: [\"actionNetworkApi\"]; Documentation URLs: [\"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.actionnetwork/\", \"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/actionnetwork/\"] | usage_mode=both\n- n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign | capability=Group: [\"transform\"] | limitations=Required Credentials: [\"activeCampaignApi\"]; Documentation URLs: [\"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.activecampaign/\", \"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/activecampaign/\"] | usage_mode=both\n- n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform | capability=Display Name: AI Transform | limitations=Required Credentials: [] | usage_mode=action_only\n- n8n-nodes-base.Brandfetch | capability=Display Name: Brandfetch | limitations=Required Credentials: [\"brandfetchApi\"]; Documentation URLs: [\"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.brandfetch/\", \"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/brandfetch/\"] | usage_mode=both\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | capability=Group: [\"transform\"] | limitations=Required Credentials: [] | usage_mode=action_only\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | capability=Display Name: Execution Data | limitations=Required Credentials: [] | usage_mode=action_only", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_candidate_summary", "total_chars": 2506, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:42.459885+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:59:53,224 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 2321, "content_preview": "{\"summaries\":[{\"node_type\":\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow\",\"capability_summary\":\"Executes another n8n workflow as a tool, enabling modular and reusable workflow design.\",\"limitations\":[\"No required credentials specified; potential lack of clear security or access control.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.emailSend\",\"capability_summary\":\"Sends emails via SMTP, suitable for routing processed emails to users' inboxes.\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires SMTP credentials; limited to email delivery only.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool\",\"capability_summary\":\"Sends emails as a tool, similar to the standard email send node but with potential additional features or integrations.\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires SMTP credentials; documentation and usage mode unclear.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork\",\"capability_summary\":\"Transforms data for Action Network, a platform for advocacy campaigns.\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires Action Network API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign\",\"capability_summary\":\"Transforms data for Active Campaign, a marketing automation platform.\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires Active Campaign API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform\",\"capability_summary\":\"Applies AI-powered transformations to data, potentially useful for summarizing emails or classifying urgency.\",\"limitations\":[\"No required credentials; limited to transformation tasks only.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.Brandfetch\",\"capability_summary\":\"Fetches brand information from Brandfetch, a logo and branding database.\",\"limitations\":[\"Requires Brandfetch API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.code\",\"capability_summary\":\"Executes custom code for data transformation, offering flexibility but requiring manual implementation.\",\"limitations\":[\"No required credentials; limited to transformation tasks only.\"]},{\"node_type\":\"n8n-nodes-base.executionData\",\"capability_summary\":\"Provides execution context or metadata, useful for debugging or logging but not directly related to email routing.\",\"limitations\":[\"No required credentials; limited to data retrieval only.\"]}]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_candidate_summary", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:53.224345+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:59:55,242 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 1037, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 103, "content": "You are a Product Manager selecting nodes for one workflow stage. Select only from provided candidates.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 2959, "content": "Select the best node bundle for this stage.\nUse case: AI-Powered Email Summarization and Urgency Classification\nStage id: stage_4\nStage objective: Route processed emails to users via their preferred channels (e.g., inbox, dashboard, or notification system).\nExpected inputs: Enriched email summaries from Stage 3\nExpected outputs: User-ready notifications with prioritized summaries, urgency indicators, and action links.\nRules:\n- Select only node types listed in candidates.\n- Prefer business-fit and stage objective alignment.\n- If evidence is insufficient, return empty selected_node_types and explain missing information.\nCandidates:\n- @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow | fit_hint=0.62 | rerank=0.49 | capability=Executes another n8n workflow as a tool, enabling modular and reusable workflow design. | limitations=No required credentials specified; potential lack of clear security or access control.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | fit_hint=0.59 | rerank=0.4 | capability=Sends emails via SMTP, suitable for routing processed emails to users' inboxes. | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials; limited to email delivery only.\n- n8n-nodes-base.emailSendTool | fit_hint=0.59 | rerank=0.4 | capability=Sends emails as a tool, similar to the standard email send node but with potential additional features or integrations. | limitations=Requires SMTP credentials; documentation and usage mode unclear.\n- n8n-nodes-base.actionNetwork | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.79 | capability=Transforms data for Action Network, a platform for advocacy campaigns. | limitations=Requires Action Network API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\n- n8n-nodes-base.activeCampaign | fit_hint=0.67 | rerank=0.79 | capability=Transforms data for Active Campaign, a marketing automation platform. | limitations=Requires Active Campaign API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\n- n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform | fit_hint=0.58 | rerank=0.43 | capability=Applies AI-powered transformations to data, potentially useful for summarizing emails or classifying urgency. | limitations=No required credentials; limited to transformation tasks only.\n- n8n-nodes-base.Brandfetch | fit_hint=0.58 | rerank=0.43 | capability=Fetches brand information from Brandfetch, a logo and branding database. | limitations=Requires Brandfetch API credentials; not directly related to email routing or urgency classification.\n- n8n-nodes-base.code | fit_hint=0.53 | rerank=0.22 | capability=Executes custom code for data transformation, offering flexibility but requiring manual implementation. | limitations=No required credentials; limited to transformation tasks only.\n- n8n-nodes-base.executionData | fit_hint=0.52 | rerank=0.22 | capability=Provides execution context or metadata, useful for debugging or logging but not directly related to email routing. | limitations=No required credentials; limited to data retrieval only.", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.1}, "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "total_chars": 3062, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:55.242999+00:00"}
2026-03-10 20:59:58,864 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 935, "content_preview": "{\"selected_node_types\":[\"n8n-nodes-base.emailSend\"],\"rationale\":\"The stage objective is to route processed emails to users via their preferred channels (e.g., inbox, dashboard, or notification system). Among the candidates, `n8n-nodes-base.emailSend` is the most aligned with this goal as it directly supports sending emails via SMTP, which fits the 'inbox' channel. While other nodes like `actionNetwork` and `activeCampaign` are related to marketing or advocacy platforms, they do not align with the stage's objective of routing user-ready notifications. Nodes like `aiTransform`, `code`, and `executionData` are more suited for transformation or debugging tasks rather than routing. The `emailSendTool` node is similar but lacks clarity in documentation and usage mode, making it less preferable compared to `emailSend`. Thus, `n8n-nodes-base.emailSend` is the best fit for this stage.\",\"pm_fit_score\":0.59,\"missing_information\":[]}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7769704b1d", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.stage_selection", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-10T19:59:58.864530+00:00"}
