equently.\",\"Design the user output stage to be flexible (e.g., support multiple notification methods).\",\"Consider adding a feedback loop where the user can correct misclassified emails to improve the AI model over time.\"],\"planning_ready\":true}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "7eedfa3a46", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-17T18:55:14.146615+00:00"}
