\",\"data_items\":[\"Emails with urgency labels\"],\"notes\":\"Classified emails are prepared for routing or further action.\"}],\"assumptions\":[\"The user has access to an AI model capable of classifying email urgency based on text content.\",\"The workflow will run continuously or at scheduled intervals to process new emails... [trimmed 681 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "c24c3ba167", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-17T20:33:45.118031+00:00"}
