2026-03-17 21:36:25,260 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"estimated_tokens": 992, "event": "llm_prompt", "message_count": 2, "messages": [{"chars": 448, "content": "You are product_manager_agent for an n8n workflow assistant. Your role is abstract workflow planning only. Design how the workflow should behave stage by stage, but do not select node types, do not mention n8n nodes, do not mention credentials, do not mention parameter names, do not mention API endpoints, and do not generate workflow JSON. You are preparing a clean handoff for a future architect_agent that will later ground the plan into nodes.", "role": "system"}, {"chars": 2475, "content": "Create an abstract workflow plan from this request context.\n\nUser request: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**, based on the chat history, to help continue or deepen the discussion. ### Guidelines: - Write all follow-up questions from the user’s point of view, directed to the assistant. - Make questions concise, clear, and directly related to the discussed topic(s). - Only suggest follow-ups that make sense given the chat content and do not repeat what was already cov...\nUse case title: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user m...\nBusiness problem: User requested a new workflow for: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**,...\nDesired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**,...\nExpected business value: Provide a high-quality workflow plan ready for architectural grounding.\nClarifications already provided:\nQuestion: Should the workflow include any specific rules for urgency classification (e.g., keywords, sender priority)?\nAnswer: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**, based on the chat history, to help continue or deepen the discussion. ### Guidelines: - Write all follow-up questions from the user’s point of view, directed to the assistant. - Ma...\n\nRules:\n- Output planning-level stages only.\n- Use 2 to 6 stages when possible.\n- Each stage must define purpose, required_capabilities, expected_inputs, expected_outputs, dependencies, and success_criteria.\n- Stages must describe behavior, not implementation details.\n- Never output concrete node types or workflow JSON.\n- If the user explicitly named systems like Gmail, Slack, or Google Sheets, treat them as business/system context, not node choices.\n- Set planning_ready=true only if the abstract workflow plan is coherent enough to hand off to architect_agent.\n- If essential planning information is missing, set planning_ready=false and list the missing_information as concise user-facing clarification questions.\n- handoff_notes must explain what architect_agent should preserve when grounding this plan into nodes.\n", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.2}, "request_id": "95b64ee5e0", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "total_chars": 2923, "ts_utc": "2026-03-17T20:36:25.260743+00:00"}
2026-03-17 21:36:41,873 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 4243, "content_preview": "{\"workflow_summary\":\"Abstract workflow plan for suggesting relevant follow-up questions or prompts based on chat history to deepen a conversation.\",\"stages\":[{\"id\":\"stage1\",\"name\":\"Analyze Chat History Context\",\"purpose\":\"Extract and summarize key themes, topics, and user intent from the ongoing conversation to understand its depth and direction.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Identify main discussion points and subtopics in a chat history.\",\"Determine the user's current focus or unresolved aspects of the topic.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"The full chat history between the user and assistant, including all prior exchanges.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A structured summary highlighting key discussion points, unresolved questions, and potential areas for deeper exploration.\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"success_criteria\":[\"The output accurately reflects the depth and direction of the conversation without overgeneralizing or missing critical details.\",\"Unresolved aspects or gaps in the discussion are clearly identified.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage ensures that follow-up questions are grounded in the actual content and flow of the conversation, avoiding generic or off-topic suggestions.\"},{\"id\":\"stage2\",\"name\":\"Generate Potential Follow-Up Questions\",\"purpose\":\"Produce 3-5 concise, relevant, and non-repetitive follow-up questions that a user might naturally ask to deepen the discussion.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Create questions that are directly related to the discussed topics without repeating prior content.\",\"Ensure questions are phrased from the user's perspective, addressing the assistant.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"The structured summary of chat history context from Stage 1.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A list of 3-5 follow-up questions or prompts that align with the conversation's themes and encourage deeper engagement.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 1: Analyze Chat History Context\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Questions are specific, clear, and directly tied to the chat history without introducing unrelated topics.\",\"The suggestions avoid redundancy and feel like natural next steps for a user.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage focuses on generating high-quality, contextually appropriate questions that push the conversation forward meaningfully.\"},{\"id\":\"stage3\",\"name\":\"Validate and Refine Questions\",\"purpose\":\"Review the generated follow-up questions to ensure they meet the guidelines (e.g., relevance, conciseness, non-repetition) and refine them if necessary.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Evaluate questions against predefined criteria (relevance, clarity, uniqueness).\",\"Adjust phrasing or content to improve alignment with the conversation's goals.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"The list of generated follow-up questions from Stage 2.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A finalized set of 3-5 high-quality follow-up questions that are ready for delivery.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 2: Generate Potential Follow-Up Questions\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"All questions strictly adhere to the guidelines (e.g., no repetition, direct relevance).\",\"The output is polished and free of ambiguity or off-topic elements.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage ensures that the final output meets the user's expectations for quality and coherence, acting as a gatekeeper against subpar suggestions.\"}],\"data_flow\":[{\"source_stage_id\":\"stage1\",\"target_stage_id\":\"stage2\",\"data_items\":[\"Structured chat history summary\"],\"notes\":\"The context extracted in Stage 1 is used to generate questions in Stage 2.\"},{\"source_stage_id\":\"stage2\",\"target_stage_id\":\"stage3\",\"data_items\":[\"Generated follow-up questions\"],\"notes\":\"Questions produced in Stage 2 are validated and refined in Stage 3.\"}],\"assumptions\":[\"The chat history is provided in a format that allows for easy extraction of key themes and unresolved aspects.\",\"The assistant has the capability to analyze conversational context effectively, including tone and user intent.\"],\"missing_information\":[],\"handoff_notes\":[\"Preserve the logical flow of context analysis → question generation → validation and refinement.\",\"... [trimmed 243 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "95b64ee5e0", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-17T20:36:41.873203+00:00"}
