  Workflow summary: A workflow that captures incoming emails, processes them using AI to classify their urgency level, and prepares the results for further action or review.
  Current stage id: stage_1
  Current stage name: Capture Incoming Emails
  Stage purpose: Collect all incoming emails from the user's email account in real-time or at specified intervals.
  Stage required capabilities: Access to the user's email account, Ability to fetch emails with metadata (sender, subject, body, timestamp)
  Stage expected inputs: User's email credentials (if required), Email filtering preferences (e.g., labels, folders, or rules for inclusion/exclusion)
  Stage expected outputs: A list of raw emails with associated metadata, Optional: Pre-filtered emails based on user-defined criteria
