2026-03-17 21:42:48,193 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 5589, "content_preview": "{\"workflow_summary\":\"A workflow that captures incoming emails, processes them to extract relevant content, classifies their urgency using AI, and prepares the results for further action or review.\",\"stages\":[{\"id\":\"stage_1\",\"name\":\"Capture Incoming Emails\",\"purpose\":\"Collect all incoming emails from the user's email account in real-time or at regular intervals to ensure no message is missed.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Access to the user's email account\",\"Real-time or batch retrieval of emails\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"User's email credentials (if applicable)\",\"Email account details\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A collection of raw incoming emails with metadata such as sender, subject, timestamp, and content\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"success_criteria\":[\"All incoming emails are captured without loss or duplication\",\"Emails are retrieved in a timely manner (e.g., within minutes of arrival)\"],\"notes\":\"This stage focuses on ensuring that all relevant emails are collected. It does not involve processing or classification yet.\"},{\"id\":\"stage_2\",\"name\":\"Preprocess Emails for AI Classification\",\"purpose\":\"Prepare the captured emails by cleaning, normalizing, and extracting key features (e.g., sender, subject, keywords) to make them suitable for urgency classification.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Text processing (cleaning, normalization)\",\"Feature extraction from email content\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Raw collection of incoming emails from Stage 1\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"Structured email data with extracted features ready for AI analysis\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 1: Output must be processed before moving forward.\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Emails are preprocessed without losing critical information\",\"Extracted features accurately represent the urgency-relevant aspects of each email\"],\"notes\":\"This stage ensures th