  Stage required capabilities: Access to the user's email inbox, Ability to fetch emails with metadata (sender, subject, body, timestamps)
  Stage expected inputs: User's email credentials or access token (if applicable), Email filtering preferences (e.g., labels, folders, or rules for inclusion/exclusion)
  Stage expected outputs: A list of raw emails with associated metadata, Optional: Pre-filtered list based on user-defined criteria
