s email client supports labeling, tagging, or metadata application for emails.\"],\"missing_information\":[],\"handoff_notes\":[\"Preserve the logical flow: Email capture → AI classification → Urgency-based organization.\",\"Ensure that the AI model is integrated in a way that allows fo... [trimmed 293 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "e185d86f0c", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-17T20:51:21.676852+00:00"}
