issing, set planning_ready=false and list the missing_information as concise user-facing clarification questions.\n- handoff_notes must explain what architect_agent should preserve when grounding this plan into nodes.\n", "role": "user"}], "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "params": {"structured": true, "temperature": 0.2}, "request_id": "bc4eb9198f", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "total_chars": 1978, "ts_utc": "2026-03-18T08:53:24.420340+00:00"}
