\"Extracted metadata is accurate and consistent\"],\"notes\":\"This stage ensures that the AI model receives high-quality, standardized input. It may involve handling attachments or formatting text for better analysis.\"},{\"id\":\"stage3\",\"name\":\"Classify Email Urgency Using AI\",\"purpose\":\"Use an AI model to analyze the preprocessed email data and assign a level of urgency (e.g., low, medium, high) based on predefined criteria or learned patterns.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"AI/ML model for urgency classification\",\"Handling of structured input data (e.g., text, metadata)\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Structured email data from Stage 2\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"Emails categorized with their assigned urgency level along with confidence scores or reasoning if available\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 2: Preprocessed and structured emails must be ready for classification\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Urgency levels are assigned accurately and consistently\",\"Confidence in the AI's classification is high (if applicable)\"],\"notes\":\"This stage is the core of the workflow, where the AI model does its primary work. The urgency criteria should be defined or learned from examples.\"},{\"id\":\"stage4\",\"name\":\"Prepare Classified Emails for Review or Action\",\"purpose\":\"Organize and present the classified emails in a way that allows the user to easily review, act on, or further process them based on their urgency level.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Grouping or sorting of emails by urgency level\",\"Optional: Integration with other tools (e.g., task management, notifications)\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Classified emails from Stage 3\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A structured output (e.g., list, dashboard) showing emails grouped or sorted by urgency level\",\"Optional: Notifications or alerts for high-urgency emails\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 3: Classified emails must be available for organization and presentation\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Emails are clearly organized by urgency level\",\"The user can easily access and act on the most urgent emails first\"],\"notes\":\"This stage focuses on usability, ensuring that the classified emails are presented in a way that supports the user's workflow.\"}],\"data_flow\":[{\"source_stage_id\":\"s... [trimmed 1274 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "bc4eb9198f", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-18T08:53:42.417317+00:00"}
