e\":\"Create a pool of potential follow-up questions or prompts based on the identified themes, gaps, and user intents from the chat history. Ensure these questions are diverse in nature but all directly related to the conversation.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Capability to generate natural language questions that are concise, clear, and contextually relevant.\",\"Ability to avoid repetition of topics already covered in the conversation.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Structured breakdown of chat history from Stage 1.\",\"Guidelines for ensuring questions adhere to the specified criteria (concise, clear, directly related).\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A list of 3-5 potential follow-up questions or prompts that could naturally arise in the conversation.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Output from Stage 1: Analysis of chat history for contextual insights.\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Generated questions should be diverse and cover different aspects of the identified themes.\",\"Questions should not repeat topics already discussed or covered in the chat history.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage is about creativity and relevance. The generated questions should feel like natural extensions of the conversation, avoiding redundancy while deepening the discussion.\"},{\"id\":\"stage_3\",\"name\":\"Refine and Validate Follow-Up Questions\",\"purpose\":\"Review and refine the generated follow-up questions to ensure they meet the quality standards (concise, clear, directly related) and align with the user's natural progression in the conversation. Remove or adjust any questions that do not fit the criteria.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Capability to evaluate the relevance and quality of generated questions against predefined guidelines.\",\"Ability to simulate user behavior to assess whether a question would naturally arise.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"List of potential follow-up questions from Stage 2.\",\"Guidelines for ensuring questions are concise, clear, and directly related.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A refined list of 3-5 high-quality follow-up questions or prompts that are ready to be suggested to the user.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Output from Stage 2: Generated potential follow-up questions.\"],\"success_criteria\":... [trimmed 2778 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "f6134f7576", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-18T08:57:44.702560+00:00"}
