ons\":[\"The chat history provided is comprehensive and accurately reflects the conversation.\",\"The user's intent can be reliably inferred from the chat history.\",\"The workflow has access to natural language processing capabilities for analyzing text.\"],\"missing_information\":[],\"handoff... [trimmed 308 chars]", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "87de41b661", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-18T09:00:31.024608+00:00"}
