  Workflow summary: Design a real-time email processing system that dynamically assigns urgency levels to incoming Gmail messages based on semantic analysis. The system should tag urgent emails and ensure they are immediately visible in the user's Gmail inbox for filtering.
  Current stage id: stage1
  Current stage name: Real-Time Email Ingestion
  Stage purpose: Capture incoming emails from Gmail as they arrive, ensuring no delay in processing urgent messages.
  Stage required capabilities: Continuous monitoring of the Gmail inbox for new messages., Immediate triggering of processing upon detection of a new email.
  Stage expected inputs: Raw incoming emails from Gmail (subject, body, sender, timestamp).
  Stage expected outputs: Stream of newly arrived emails ready for urgency assessment.
