2026-03-18 10:15:52,773 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 4379, "content_preview": "{\"workflow_summary\":\"Design an abstract workflow that captures incoming emails, processes them through an AI model to classify urgency levels, and prepares the results for further action or review.\",\"stages\":[{\"id\":\"stage_1\",\"name\":\"Email Collection\",\"purpose\":\"Gather all incoming emails from the user's email source into a centralized location for processing.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Access to the user's email inbox or mailbox.\",\"Ability to fetch and store incoming emails with metadata (e.g., sender, subject, timestamp).\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Incoming emails from the user's email source.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A collection of raw emails with associated metadata, ready for processing.\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"success_criteria\":[\"All incoming emails are successfully captured and stored without loss or duplication.\",\"Metadata is preserved to support later classification.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage focuses on ensuring no email is missed during the collection process. It should handle batch processing if emails arrive in bursts.\"},{\"id\":\"stage_2\",\"name\":\"AI Urgency Classification\",\"purpose\":\"Analyze each email using an AI model to determine its urgency level (e.g., low, medium, high).\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Integration with an AI model capable of natural language processing and urgency classification.\",\"Ability to process emails in a batch or sequential manner based on volume.\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Raw emails from the previous stage, including metadata.\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"A list of emails annotated with their respective urgency levels, along with any additional context or reasoning provided by the AI model.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 1: Email Collection\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Each email is classified accurately and consistently based on its content and metadata.\",\"The classification process